:: StoryTitle
Inumamotchi - Three Days


:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "9FEE85C5-DF66-4E63-A8A6-FA7D528AA6F4",
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3.3.9",
  "start": "Start",
  "zoom": 1
}


:: Day1 Breakfast {"position":"525,25","size":"100,100"}
The human fills your bowl, then pours a coffee and sits at the desk with it. No toast.

Above the sofa there are pictures on the wall. Other humans, smiling.

[[Sit under the pictures->Day1 Pictures]]
[[Bring the leash->Day1 Walk]]


:: Day1 Jump {"position":"275,25","size":"100,100"}
(set: $trust to it + 1)\
You land on the human's stomach. The human makes a noise like a squeaky toy, then laughs and rubs your ears.

//Thought bubble: a gold medal.//

[[Lead the way to the bowl->Day1 Breakfast]]


:: Day1 Pictures {"position":"650,25","size":"100,100"}
(set: $clues to it + 1)\
You sit and stare up at the pictures. The human looks up too, for a long time.
"They'd like you," the human says. You don't know who "they" are. A pack, somewhere else?

//Thought bubble: many humans. Where?//

[[Bring the leash->Day1 Walk]]


:: Day1 Sunbeam {"position":"400,25","size":"100,100"}
(set: $drift to it + 1)\
The sunbeam is perfect. Much later the human gets up alone, slowly, and smile at you.

//Thought bubble: the sun. Good choice. Probably.//

[[Go to the bowl->Day1 Breakfast]]


:: Day1 Wake {"position":"150,25","size":"100,100"}
''Day 1 — morning''

The human is a warm lump under the blanket. Breakfast is somewhere in the future, and the future is taking too long.

[[Jump on the bed->Day1 Jump]]
[[Lie in the sunbeam instead->Day1 Sunbeam]]


:: Day1 Walk {"position":"775,25","size":"100,100"}
The walk is short but there is a squirrel. You do not catch the squirrel. Nobody has ever caught the squirrel.

The night came fast, the owner is getting ready to sleep. You settle on the bed. The owner get in next to you ,hugs you and saying "good night".

[[Sleep->Day2 Start]]


:: Day2 Bad Ignore {"position":"150,150","size":"100,100"}
(set: $drift to it + 1)\
The sunbeam is warm, but somehow less warm today. The human gets up in the afternoon.

[[Later that day->Day2 Floor]]


:: Day2 Bad Stay {"position":"25,150","size":"100,100"}
(set: $trust to it + 1)\
You climb up and lie down, back to back. You stay. You are very good at staying.

After a while a hand finds your fur. The human gets up, slowly.

//Thought bubble: a paw on a hand.//

[[Later that day->Day2 Floor]]


:: Day2 Bad Wake {"position":"1150,25","size":"100,100"}
You whine at the bedside. Nothing.
You tug the blanket. Nothing.

[[Climb up and lie against the human->Day2 Bad Stay]]
[[Give up and go to the sunbeam->Day2 Bad Ignore]]


:: Day2 Comfort {"position":"400,150","size":"100,100"}
(set: $trust to it + 1)\
(if: $trust >= 3)[The human turns toward you at once and holds on. After a while they sit up and move to the sofa, with you.]
(else:)[It takes a long time. Then the human turns toward you, and sits up.]

There was no wrong choice. There was only being there.

[[Sleep->Day3 Start]]


:: Day2 Floor {"position":"275,150","size":"100,100"}
In the evening the human is lying on the floor in the middle of the room. Not sleeping. Just lying there.

You don't know what this game is. You know where you want to be.

[[Lie down beside the human->Day2 Comfort]]
[[Nudge the hand->Day2 Comfort]]
[[Fetch the orange throw->Day2 Comfort]]


:: Day2 Good {"position":"1025,25","size":"100,100"}
(set: $trust to it + 1)\
You put your chin on the bed. The human scratches it without looking away from the phone, then does look, and smiles.

At midday a letter falls through the door.

[[Bring the letter->Day2 Letter]]
[[Leave it and chase the pigeon->Day2 Pigeon]]


:: Day2 Letter {"position":"525,150","size":"100,100"}
(set: $trust to it + 1)(set: $clues to it + 1)\
You carry the letter in your mouth (only slightly wet) and drop it on the human's foot.
The human reads the name on it, goes still, then opens it. The human smiles at the paper the way they smile at the pictures on the wall.

[[Sleep->Day3 Start]]


:: Day2 Pigeon {"position":"650,150","size":"100,100"}
The pigeon is defeated. The pigeon comes back. The pigeon is never really defeated.
The letter stays by the door all day.

//Thought bubble: you, wearing a crown.//

[[Sleep->Day3 Start]]


:: Day2 Start {"position":"900,25","size":"100,100"}
(set: $day to 2)\
''Day 2 — morning''

(if: $drift > 0)[The house feels quieter today. The blanket doesn't move.
[[Try to wake the human->Day2 Bad Wake]]]
(else:)[The human is already sitting up, looking at the phone.
[[Say good morning->Day2 Good]]]


:: Day3 Start {"position":"775,150","size":"100,100"}
(set: $day to 3)\
''Day 3''

(if: $clues >= 2)[In the afternoon the human picks up the phone, looks at the pictures on the wall, and calls someone. You hear the human laugh, a real one. You don't understand any of the words. You understand the laugh.
[[Evening->Ending Deep]]]
(else-if: $drift >= 2)[The human stays at the desk until it is dark. The screen is the only light in the house.
[[Lie down under the desk->Ending Quiet]]]
(else:)[An ordinary day. Breakfast, a walk, the squirrel (still free), dinner.
[[Evening->Ending Ordinary]]]


:: Ending Deep {"position":"900,150","size":"100,100"}
''A deep day''

That night the human calls //you// to the bed, before you even ask.
Trust: $trust

Tomorrow there will be another day. Some will be hard. You'll be there for those too.

[[Play again->Start]]


:: Ending Ordinary {"position":"1150,150","size":"100,100"}
''An ordinary day''

The human falls asleep on the sofa with the TV on. You pull the orange throw over them. Mostly over them.
Trust: $trust

Tomorrow there will be another day.

[[Play again->Start]]


:: Ending Quiet {"position":"1025,150","size":"100,100"}
''A quiet day''

You lie on the human's feet under the desk. After a long time the hand comes down to your head, and the screen goes off.
Trust: $trust

Nothing is lost. Tomorrow you'll try again. Good dogs always do.

[[Play again->Start]]


:: Start {"position":"25,25","size":"100,100"}
(set: $trust to 0)(set: $drift to 0)(set: $clues to 0)(set: $day to 1)\
''Inumamotchi 犬守っち''
//Every good boy knows how to take care of his human.//

You are a dog. This house is the whole world.
Your human is asleep. The sun is already on the floor.

[[Start the day->Day1 Wake]]
